values ('f8a9b0c1-2d3e-4f85-8a45-5c6d7e8f9a55', 'teaching-elementary-social-studies', 'Teaching Elementary Social Studies', 'This methods course prepares future elementary teachers to design inquiry-based, standards-aligned, inclusive social studies learning for grades K-6. Students learn to teach history, geography, civics, economics, culture, current events, media literacy, and democratic participation through sources, maps, children''s literature, local/community inquiry, fieldwork, discussion, performance assessment, and service learning.');

